        {
         "id": "b_h8kpvag3",
         "type": "text",
         "props": {
          "html": "<p>Your note lands with Fiona in the shed, not in a ticket queue. If a voyage fits, she will say which one and why; if none does, she will say that too. Nothing you send here commits you to anything, and nobody adds you to a mailing list for asking.</p>"
